{
  "name": "Split Filter and Summarize (Core) – DEMO",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1 – Split\n**HTTP Request** gets 5 sample shopping carts (one item with a `carts` list).\n**Split Out** turns that list into 5 items, then **Split Out1** turns each cart's `products` into separate items.\n\nWatch the item count on the lines grow: 1 → 5 → ~20.",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 660,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "8c4bd33b-d8a3-4897-9bb5-334b8d20a212",
      "name": "Note – Split",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -512,
        -528
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2 – Filter\nClean the list without code:\n**Remove Duplicates** (same title) → **Filter** (price > 50) → **Sort** (highest price first) → **Limit** (top 10).",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 860,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "84f3e920-01c6-407d-9112-707998ec6805",
      "name": "Note – Filter",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        208,
        -528
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3 – Loop\n**Loop Over Items** sends 3 items at a time through **Wait** (1 s) and **Code**, then loops back.\nThis is how you stay under an API's rate limit.\nWhen all items are done, they leave through the **done** output.",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 700,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "3c3d919f-9d2e-47a5-b74c-a0749fb1a234",
      "name": "Note – Loop",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -512,
        -208
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 4 – Summarize\n**Summarize** groups items by price band (count + total), and **Convert to File** turns that into a CSV you can download.\n**Aggregate** squeezes many items back into one list of product names.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nby Naji El Kotob + AI",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 640,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "724603aa-1ee7-4b41-a386-b42099ddc2d2",
      "name": "Note – Summarize",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        -208
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "6ee524a6-32f3-4ba0-8b2d-3020c647bbac",
      "name": "When clicking ‘Execute workflow’",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -464,
